Article 5 (Matters for Consultation)
A council shall consult on the following matters involving the relevant local governments: <Amended on April 2, 2026.>
1. Formulation, amendment and implementation of urban plans;
2. Development of housing complexes and industrial complexes;
3. Construction, improvement and repair of roads;
4. Establishment, modification and abolition of bus routes;
5. Installation of water supply and sewerage facilities;
6. Facilities to prevent environmental pollution and matters concerning monitoring;
7. Development, use and investigation of resources;
8. Other matters concerning the installation and management of public facilities;
9. Matters other than those specified in subparagraphs 1 through 8 for which consultation through the council is deemed advisable.
